<title>TURKMENISTAN: TABLE-Turkmen H1 industry output plunges 35.2 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Turkmen H1 industry output plunges 35.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's industrial output in the first six months of this year was 35.2 percent lower than a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>TURKMENISTAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT  Jan-June 97  Jan-June 96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	     -35.2	  +32.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
